	/**
	 * True when the entry row is exactly reproducible from the given layout and base bindings — the same seeding the
	 * workers will perform — so workers can re-seed it themselves. A live row carrying additional correlated slots
	 * would not be reproducible and keeps the sequential route.
	 */
